    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "96e614766df01569",
      "translationZh": "我是 TensorSharp 的开发者，这是一个开源 LLM 推理引擎。下面介绍最新的 DeepSeek V4.1 Flash 优化。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2aba1e828565a3d2",
      "translationZh": "硬件：8× NVIDIA A40，采用按层拆分执行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4815acfaade7c2ad",
      "translationZh": "测量项 优化后的结果",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6af857489b89708a",
      "translationZh": "Q2_K 单请求解码",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b74c52071de27e59",
      "translationZh": "Q2_K 预填充，Engram 驻留 GPU 测试",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d7e42410ce998905",
      "translationZh": "Q2_K 模型冷加载，MooseFS 存储",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "09861043d7e0ab72",
      "translationZh": "144–155 秒（速度约为原来的 2.5×）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e6164db51a1d2d29",
      "translationZh": "带来改进的关键：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a4135844c0686379",
      "translationZh": "减少同步：在每个 GPU 上，将 CUDA 和自定义算子封装到同一个后端中，使解码图分区数从 565–577 减少到 8，解码速度从 35.6 提升到 41.1 tok/s——提高了约 15%。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b03562af82da02e6",
      "translationZh": "GPU 驻留的 Engram：量化查找表保留在 GPU 上，避免了在 CPU 上进行行查找，并消除了约 130 秒的主机端表预热。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "86c48601a58c0fdf",
      "translationZh": "顺序加载胜过增加线程：为每个读取器分配一段连续的文件范围，恢复了网络存储上的有效预读——这是加载速度提升 2.5× 的主要原因。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a2c7d46adc63930d",
      "translationZh": "这些是项目基准测试结果，并非声称优于 llama.cpp：在所记录的对比中，没有可用的、使用相同权重的兼容参考实现。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1fe8e3d20db397c6",
      "translationZh": "非常欢迎大家对实现提出反馈，并独立运行基准测试！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b853053f39deca92",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/fuzhongkai 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
